{
 "id": "274-39",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Consistency is key in our team, and we want to ensure our code is easily understandable for all team members.",
  "When you're writing code for our projects, I want you to follow this simple rule: always start function argument names with 'e_' and always end method names with '_o'.",
  "This helps us quickly identify the purpose and scope of each function and method.",
  "It's important to prioritize your comfort and health, especially since we spend a large portion of our day sitting and working at our desks.",
  "Adjusting your chair height and screen position can make a huge difference.",
  "Your arms should be at a 90-degree angle when typing, with your wrists straight and in a neutral position.",
  "Your health and comfort are important to your overall productivity and well-being.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns about your workspace.",
  "We can always make adjustments to ensure you're feeling your best.",
  "Yes, another important factor is your ability to work well with others.",
  "So, ensure you're a team player, contribute in meetings, and are always willing to help your colleagues.",
  "Keep a record of your accomplishments, any positive feedback you receive, and specifically, any instances where your work has had a notable impact on the company or a particular project.",
  "It's also helpful to have metrics or data to support your case, so keep track of any relevant statistics or measurements.",
  "Exactly, and remember, your performance isn't just about the quantity of work you produce, but also the quality and impact.",
  "So, always strive for excellence, and don't be afraid to speak up and share your ideas.",
  "Your initiative and innovation are valued here.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any more questions or concerns."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
